  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Weapon(Club), Special Grade</em></p><p>You have a +4 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this weapon. You can spend up to 10 cursed energy as an action to send out a blast of lightning against up to 5 creatures within 120 ft. Each creature must make a DC 22 Constitution saving throw, taking 2d12 lightning damage per CE spent or half as much damage on a successful save. A creature that gets a 10 or less on the save is paralyzed until the end of their next turn.</p>"
